# Ramindo Autonesia Logicraft-based Theme (RALT)

A bootstrap theme for [Ramindo Autonesia](https://ramindoautonesia.com) based
on [Logicraft](https://github.com/furioustheme/logicraft) theme by
[furioustheme](https://furioustheme.com/).

This project was created by Ramindo Autonesia in 2022 and is licensed under
MIT.
